WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.400
fetch takes time: await it, turn the reply into data, then show it

2
00:00:05.375 --> 00:00:07.700
The page says Loading while it waits.

3
00:00:08.651 --> 00:00:12.101
fetch asks for the file; await waits for the reply.

4
00:00:12.727 --> 00:00:16.527
Jason turns the reply into data; await waits again.

5
00:00:17.429 --> 00:00:19.654
Then show part of it on the page.

6
00:00:24.883 --> 00:00:27.808
Loading, then the data, once it has arrived.
